{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rjd0leFqw4WD7Q312F7b6A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:21.642609+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rjd0leFqw4WD7Q312F7b6A","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>中国科学院上海高等研究院（以下简称“上海高研院”）是由中国科学院和上海市人民政府共建的科研机构，坐落于上海张江，以先进光源大科学装置的研制、建设和运行为核心，开展加速器科学、光子科学、能源科学与信息科学领域的原始创新研究和关键核心技术研发，支撑前沿科学研究，为战略新兴产业提供核心技术和集成技术解决方案。</span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><p><span>院所简介</span></p></strong></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>（一）多元培养，厚植根基</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>上海高研院已构建起多元育人矩阵：培养层次涵盖从博士到硕士，育人方向兼顾学术型与专业型，拥有6个一级学科博士/硕士培养点、1个工程博士培养点以及3个硕士专业学位授权领域，并与上海科技大学、张江实验室等高校和科研院所开展科教融合、协同育人。</span></p><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>（二）全球视野，开放共生</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span>目前，上海高研院已与美国、德国、英国、法国、意大利、瑞士、日本等国家的顶尖高校与科研机构并肩探索，与跨国企业携手推进技术产业化。多边协作的科研生态与全球联动的资源网络，让你起步即与世界同频。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>（三）厚奖优助，潜心笃学</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span>国家奖学金、中国科学院大学各类专项奖学金、上海高研院企业奖学金等多重奖励体系，叠加丰厚的助学金与生活补贴，让你拥有沉潜科研的底气，更专注于在科学的星辰大海中扬帆远航。</span></p></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>（四）诚挚邀约，共赴卓越</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span>如果你手握推荐免试资格，渴望在物理学、化学、电子科学与技术、信息与通信工程、化学工程与技术、核科学与技术学科，以及电子信息、材料与化工、生物与医药等领域绽放才华，这里将是你从优秀走向卓越的起点。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>加入上海高研院——</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>让科研理想扎根中国大地，</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>让创新力量映照世界舞台。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>我们等你来，</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>共赴一场改变未来的科学之约！</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><p><span><span>招生概况</span></span></p></strong></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>1</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生导师</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span>上海高研院现有导师253名，其中博导135名，硕导118名。导师介绍及研究方向信息可查询研究生教育栏目下师资队伍介绍：</span></p><p><span>http://www.sari.cas.cn/gradedu/szdw/gykx/gzkx/。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>2</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span>2027年，上海高研院将在以下学科专业招收推免硕士生和直博生。</span></p><section><img alt=\"招生专业.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/FNqSTO2IqMKaZOMMfoqcHab3KE8hFbnb2yicvibvpulcC5SvkPstCKic0Ic3ZHW7xiaWdsAju3rAPyn4KBbic4WR4icA1wUakUMGBK8QgjVznP6nA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>3</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span>申请上海高研院推荐免试研究生（含直博生）应具备如下条件：</span></p><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，道德品质良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>2.须获得所在学校当年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）资格，并在教育部中国研究生招生信息网“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”）中获得母校推荐免试资格名单备案；</span></p><p><span>3.诚实守信，学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪受处分记录；</span></p><p><span>4.在大学本科阶段学习成绩优异，热爱科学事业，具有较好的科研潜力，具有较强的调查研究、分析问题、解决问题能力；</span></p><p><span>5.外语程度良好，具有较强的外语听、说、读、写能力；</span></p><p><span>6.身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>04</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>即日起至2026年9月18日。（可视招生及高校推免等实际情况适当延长）。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>5</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span>1.登录：预计能获得所读高校推荐免试资格的考生，可通过中国科学院大学（以下简称“国科大”）招生信息网进行申请，网址：http://admission.ucas.ac.cn。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>如：在网页右下角找到“在线报名”图标，点击“硕士”进入“推荐免试申请系统”页面。</span></span></strong></p><p><span>2.注册：</span><span><span>在报考单位搜索框内</span></span><span><strong><span><span>输入“上海高等研究院”进行报名。</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span>3.填报：“推荐免试生申请系统”中可暂不填报导师，研究方向可任选一个。</span></p><p><span>（二）提交材料 </span></p><p><strong></strong><span><span>通过国科大招生信息网推荐免试申请系统报名后，须于9月18日前登录上海高研院预推免报名系统（9月批次）（https://graduatenew.sari.ac.cn/yjszs/plugins/zs/zsxsd/entrance#/entrance 上海高研院研究生招生系统学生端）提交电子扫描件材料。</span></span></p><p><span>1.《中国科学院大学推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生/直博生申请表》，申请表可以通过报名系统中的报表途径在线打印，经申请人签字确认有效 </span></p><p><span>2.所在学校（或院系）教务部门加盖公章的大学本科前三年所修课程成绩单（五年制的提供前四年课程成绩单） </span></p><p><span>3.个人简历及专业学习情况介绍 </span></p><p><span>4.有效居民身份证正反面扫描件（正反面放在一张A4纸同一面上） </span></p><p><span>5.英语等级证</span></p><p><span>6.政审表（见附件1）</span></p><p><span>7.其他自愿提交的材料：大学期间获奖证书复印件；在公开发行的学术刊物或全国性学术会议上发表的学术论文、所获专利或其他原创性工作成果的复印件或证明；对申请有参考价值的其他材料等。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>06</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span>1.登录：预计能获得所读高校推荐免试资格的考生，可通过中国科学院大学（以下简称“国科大”）招生信息网进行申请，网址：http://admission.ucas.ac.cn。</span></p><p><span>如：在网页右下角找到“在线报名”图标，点击“硕士”进入“推荐免试申请系统”页面。</span></p><p><span>2.注册：在报考单位搜索框内输入“上海高等研究院”进行报名。</span></p><p><span>3.填报：“推荐免试生申请系统”中可暂不填报导师，研究方向可任选一个。</span></p><p><span>（二）提交材料 </span></p><p><span> 通过国科大招生信息网推荐免试申请系统报名后，须于9月18日前登录上海高研院预推免报名系统（9月批次）（https://graduatenew.sari.ac.cn/yjszs/plugins/zs/zsxsd/entrance#/entrance 上海高研院研究生招生系统学生端）提交电子扫描件材料。</span></p><p><span>1.《中国科学院大学推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生/直博生申请表》，申请表可以通过报名系统中的报表途径在线打印，经申请人签字确认有效 </span></p><p><span>2.所在学校（或院系）教务部门加盖公章的大学本科前三年所修课程成绩单（五年制的提供前四年课程成绩单） </span></p><p><span>3.个人简历及专业学习情况介绍 </span></p><p><span>4.有效居民身份证正反面扫描件（正反面放在一张A4纸同一面上） </span></p><p><span>5.英语等级证</span></p><p><span>6.政审表（见附件1）</span></p><p><span>7.其他自愿提交的材料：大学期间获奖证书复印件；在公开发行的学术刊物或全国性学术会议上发表的学术论文、所获专利或其他原创性工作成果的复印件或证明；对申请有参考价值的其他材料等。</span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>7</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>特别申明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span>1.请必须保证提交的全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。因申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确而造成的一切后果，由申请人自行承担。对拟录取的推荐免试生，出现下列情况之一的，取消其录取资格：</span></p><p><span>（1）在本科阶段最后一学年（四年制的指第七、八学期，五年制的指第九、十学期）专业主干课程学习成绩有不及格科目；</span></p><p><span>（2）毕业设计（论文）未取得良好以上（含良好）成绩；</span></p><p><span>（3）毕业时未获得本科毕业证书或学士学位； </span></p><p><span>（4）政审不合格； </span></p><p><span>（5）考试作弊者或违纪（法）受到“警告”以上处分的，或有其他情节严重的违法乱纪行为受到处罚者；</span></p><p><span>（6）申请人提交的材料有弄虚作假者。 </span></p><p><span>2.体检表待面试通过后另行通知提交（见附件2）。</span></p><p><span>3.预计将于2027年4月对拟录取的推荐免试生在本科阶段最后一学年的学习成绩和遵纪守法表现进行复审。</span></p><p><span>4.本公告未尽报考事宜，请后续参看《中国科学院上海高等研究院2027年招收攻读硕士学位研究生简章》和《中国科学院上海高等研究院2027年招收攻读博士学位研究生简章》。 </span></p><p><span>5.本公告如有与国家新出台的招生政策或中国科学院大学相关文件要求（含相关时间节点）不符的事项，以上级单位新政策或文件为准。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>8</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span>🏠联系单位：</span></p><p><span>中国科学院上海高等研究院研究生处</span></p><p><span>📌联系地址：</span></p><p><span>上海市浦东新区海科路99号综合楼322室</span></p><p><span>☎️联系电话：</span></p><p><span>021-20608059</span></p><p><span>✉️电子邮箱：</span></p><p><span>lishuainan2019@sari.ac.cn</span></p><p><span>🖥️官方网站：</span></p><p><span>https://www.sari.cas.cn/gradedu/ </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>注：上海高研院博士、硕士的招生简章尚在修订，暂未发布，预计9月中旬对外发布。请考生们及时关注研究生教育网站相关信息。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span>END</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/FNqSTO2IqMIfFhRnlSrnJYqnssLSzOlFQ5T0iadb3NmRGHDU7fGiaRQ3hiak41xjicZZY5lK9DdVnsLgo4GfFeGSWAQhicsbSMOKr40BgfO0aQicc/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/FNqSTO2IqMLC5WiaAASibyO27QUo1ias2R401biazV95uWhurvRicTuvZhcuO00aQL0AusUlZiaUByO4wibic9DK9TpoTuicZfKOaUXL4zUN2GOsh6Q8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>附件：</span></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rjd0leFqw4WD7Q312F7b6A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件1-中国科学院上海高等研究院2027年招收推免政审材料.docx</span></a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rjd0leFqw4WD7Q312F7b6A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件2-中国科学院上海高等研究院2027年研究生招生检查表.docx</span></a></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"755ab2f381c50f74887b1213125f25b927f380e8adc9e75c93985cf483d21ab8","textLength":3176,"sourceSha256":"9ed9a644298d9d3d8ff1a90250abcffe0085ec43bebfc56712dc386f7b95cc6a","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5474df1f0fc98160320c","title":"2026年中国科学院上海高等研究院接收2027年推荐免试研究生招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:21.642609+00:00"}
